--- !u!114 &365871578
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 365871575}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe world is no longer the same.\r\n\r\nA
    mysterious virus leaked from abandoned laboratories in the aftermath of a devastating
    biological war. Within months, the infection spread across every continent.\r\n\r\nThose
    infected lost all sense of humanity\u2026 transforming into relentless, bloodthirsty
    creatures known as Zombies.\r\n\r\nCivilization collapsed. Governments fell.\r\nCities
    were reduced to ruins.\r\n\r\nStrategic locations \u2014 military bases, power
    plants, airports, seaports \u2014 were either abandoned\u2026 or seized by new
    forces.\r\n\r\nFrom the ashes of chaos, terrorist organizations emerged.\r\n\r\nThey
    claimed control over vital resources, occupied key territories, and exploited
    the pandemic to expand their influence.\r\n\r\nWhat remained of humanity was
    dragged into a new era of war.\r\n\r\nTo resist total annihilation, a global
    alliance was formed:\r\n\r\nDelta Special Force.\r\n\r\nAn elite unit tasked
    with humanity\u2019s last hope.\r\n\r\nTheir missions:\r\n\r\nReclaim strategic
    locations from terrorist control\r\nDefend safe zones against relentless Zombie
    waves\r\nExecute high-risk operations in abandoned territories\r\n\r\nBut in
    this shattered world\u2026\r\nnot everyone fights for the same cause.\r\n\r\nSome
    stand with the Counter Force \u2014 warriors determined to restore order and
    rebuild civilization.\r\n\r\nOthers align with the Terrorist Organization \u2014
    factions seeking to dominate the new world through power and fear.\r\n\r\nYour
    Role\r\n\r\nYou are a soldier stepping onto the battlefield of a broken world.\r\n\r\nChoose
    your path:\r\n\r\nCounter Force \u2014 fight to reclaim humanity\u2019s future\r\nTerrorist
    Organization \u2014 seize power and control what remains\r\n\r\nIn the ruins
    of civilization, you must:\r\n\r\nEngage enemy forces in intense combat\r\nSurvive
    relentless waves of Zombies\r\nMaster weapons, tactics, and battlefield awareness\r\n\r\nIn
    this world, there are only two choices:\r\n\r\nFight\u2026 or fall.\r\n\r\nTutorial
    Begins\r\n\r\nBefore entering real combat, you will undergo basic training:\r\n\r\nMovement
    and character control\r\nAiming and weapon handling\r\nCombat in active battle
    environments\r\n\r\nPrepare yourself.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25012353426010747b87875ede29f139, type: 2}
